# transfer-system-algorithms

The transfer system implements specialized workflows for warrant service and inmate tracking communications:

## Agent Availability Routing
- Consent-based warm transfer system coordinates handoffs between initial contact and law enforcement agents
- Configurable hold states with custom audio during transfer wait periods
- Multi-attempt calling sequences with timeout thresholds

## Transfer Acceptance Flows
- DTMF-based accept/decline decision points for receiving agents
- Agent whisper messaging system provides case context before connection
- Fallback routing logic when primary agent unavailable

## Communication Channels
- Hybrid SMS and voice channel coordination
- Bail status notification integration
- Real-time status updates during transfer process

## Location Integration 
- Geographic agent assignment based on warrant jurisdiction
- Last known location tracking during transfer coordination
- Administrative geofencing for permitted transfer zones

